    "raw_output": "```rust\npub fn cap_per_key(keys: &[String], limit: isize) -> Option<Vec<usize>> {\n    if limit < 0 {\n        return None;\n    }\n\n    let mut result: Vec<usize> = Vec::with_capacity(keys.len());\n    let mut seen: std::collections::HashSet<usize> = std::collections::HashSet::new();\n\n    for (i, key) in keys.iter().enumerate() {\n        if seen.contains(&i) {\n            continue;\n        }\n\n        if limit == 0 {\n            break;\n        }\n\n        if seen.insert(i) {\n            result.push(i);\n            if result.len() == limit {\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    Some(result)\n}\n```<|im_end|>",
